<title>CANADA: UGG details W. Canada wheat quality.</title>
<headline>UGG details W. Canada wheat quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Grain Growers Ltd Wednesday issued its first wheat quality estimate for the 1996/97 (Aug/July) crop year.</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat  Man  Sask Alta W.Cnd 10-yr-avg</p>
<p>No1 CWRS		   45%  36%  19%  33%   38%</p>
<p>No2 CWRS		   42%  23%   9%  22%   26%</p>
<p>No3 CWRS		    8%  33%  42%  31%   24%</p>
<p>Feed Wheat		  5%   8%  30%  14%   12%</p>
<p>Durum Wheat</p>
<p>No1 CWAD		   ---  21%  61%  26%   23%</p>
<p>No2 CWAD		   10%  25%  22%  24%   26%</p>
<p>No3 CWAD		   50%  31%   8%  28%   31%</p>
<p>No4 CWAD		   33%  18%   6%  17%   13%</p>
<p>No5 CWAD		    7%   5%   3%   5%    8%</p>
<p>--Gilbert Le Gras 204-947-3548</p>
</text>
